rse of dealing ('the longer way twice', 'same route every time') cites no artifact — the trip's chat log is empty — and carries no weight under POL-RD-08; the driver's 'today was peak' answer does not explain distance, since the only time-of-day multiplier on the record is fare_breakdown.surge_multiplier, which reads 1.0; and there are no ERP, toll or surcharge lines on this fare (all 0.00, on a trip that neither originates nor ends at an airport), so no standalone pass-through correction under POL-RD-09 arises in either direction and no billing-integrity referral fires. Confidence is stated below the platform's 0.70 floor because the exculpation question rests on an artifact that is not in the record."
